<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.guest.installs ~ the sidecar's library deps, outside the vessel root

`lares mempalace install` installs the read-only sidecar submodule's library deps into the operator's own Python environment, then links its console scripts into `~/.local/bin` so a hook or MCP environment finds them without the venv. Founding never reaches it; already installed reads as a skip. A failed step skips the link and exits 1.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ install

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`install` params=`~ install the sidecar deps`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ writes the operator's own Python environment, outside the vessel root; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

